operatorname{arctan}⁡(a)-\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(1)] \\\\  & =2\\cdot ({lim}_{a\\to \\infty }[\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(a)]-\\frac{\\pi }{4})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, recall the end behavior of the function $y=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x),$ shown in the graph below:\n\n- ${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }[\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)]=-\\frac{\\pi }{2}$\n\n- ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }[\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)]=\\frac{\\pi }{2}$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052212/assets/46e6cf2950c99831a7445a862fb36a6a7b8f9233a82e49c7cf5da4a383ec4756.png)\n\nUsing this to evaluate our integral, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}(x+1)}\\,\\text{d}x & =2\\cdot ({lim}_{a\\to \\infty }[\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(a)]-\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =2\\cdot (\\frac{\\pi }{2}-\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535110 true] [17592186331856 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331857 13194139535110 true] [17592186331856 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331858 13194139535110 true] [17592186331856 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331859 13194139535110 true] [17592186331856 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331860 13194139535110 true] [17592186331856 1000 #edb/ref 17592186331861 13194139535110 true] [17592186331856 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535110 true] [17592186331856 1041 "selection" 13194139535110 true] [17592186331856 1104 #edb/ref 17592186331860 13194139535110 true] [17592186331856 1110 #uuid "a0bab367-668d-5922-92ae-db8a6ac76211" 13194139535110 true] [17592186331857 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{8}" 13194139535110 true] [17592186331857 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535110 true] [17592186331857 1111 #uuid "da01d72b-39c2-5784-8d83-98a552b568ca" 13194139535110 true] [17592186331858 1034 "The integral diverges" 13194139535110 true] [17592186331858 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535110 true] [17592186331858 1111 #uuid "a1675bc8-d54e-574a-a989-c969c619f103" 13194139535110 true]